# Members portal — public directory rules.
#
# This directory is served by the web, so it holds only what the browser
# needs: one entry file per page, and assets/. Application code lives in
# src/ and presentation in templates/, both of which the ROOT .htaccess
# denies by path. They are denied there rather than here on purpose: a
# per-directory rule in this file would not survive a future RewriteEngine
# here, and the root block is the one place that is already tested.
#
# There is deliberately no RewriteEngine in this file. All routing for
# /members/* lives in the root .htaccess.

Options -Indexes -MultiViews

# /members is this directory; answer it with the front controller even if the
# hosting's default DirectoryIndex is something else.
DirectoryIndex index.php
